      "Varaalenno varshinchu nee gunam",
      "Nivaalai samarpinthu naa jeevitham",
      "Vidhaathai ilaa korukunnaavugaa nanne aadharinchaavugaa",
      "Sadaa neevu naa thodugaa Yesayya",
      "Padhe prema choopaavugaa"
